  "display_title": "Love Sentence",
  "description": "\"What!? You think I can’t do it just because I am a woman? Which year are we in?\" \n\nOn her first day at the prosecutor’s office for her internship, Choe Yeong-Hun is dismissed by Kim Yun-Jae, a popular prosecutor loved for his appearance and ability, who thought it was a male employee coming after looking at the name in the application…….. \n\nCan Yeong-Hun who thinks love is a luxury and Yun-Jae who doesn’t believe in love, be able to coexist peacefully? \n\n(Source: Naver, translated) \n\n*Note: The series went on a hiatus after the conclusion of the first season on April 2021.*",
